    "evidence_contract": "For each current fact, cite its latest direct setting or confirming message. An explicit unknown or cleared fact has value null and cites that message. A field never established has value null and an empty evidence list. Proposals and drafts do not overwrite approved facts. A message changes only the fields it explicitly states; keep other fields unchanged.",
